  "_note": "A long-term gain on an equity share whose sale bore no securities transaction tax cannot meet S2 s.198(1)(c) / 1961 s.112A(1)(iii) and is charged under S2 s.197(1) (TY 2026-27, p.221): \"includes any income arising from the transfer of a long-term capital asset which is chargeable under the head 'Capital gains'\" — no asset condition — and 1961 s.112(1) (TY 2025-26, thc copy pp.462–463), whatever STT the buy bore (D-289). Sources: docs/taxplanning-build/sources/2026-10-18-capital-gains-basis.md rows 2, 4–9.",
